### ==========================================
### CODECRAFT HUB API TESTS
### ==========================================


### 1. Hello
GET http://localhost:8080/


### 2. API Status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/status


### ==========================================
### GET COURSES
### ==========================================

### 3. Get all courses
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses


### 4. Get course by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1


### 5. Get non-existing course
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/999


### ==========================================
### CREATE COURSE
### ==========================================

### 6. Create course
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Java Fundamentals",
  "description": "Learn the basics of Java programming",
  "target_date": "2026-12-21",
  "status": "Not Started"
}


### 7. Create second course
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Spring Boot",
  "description": "Build REST APIs with Spring Boot",
  "target_date": "2026-12-25",
  "status": "In Progress"
}


### 8. Create completed course
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Python for AI",
  "description": "Learn Python for Artificial Intelligence",
  "target_date": "2026-11-30",
  "status": "Completed"
}


### ==========================================
### UPDATE COURSE
### ==========================================

### 9. Update course
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Advanced Java",
  "description": "Learn advanced Java programming",
  "target_date": "2027-01-15",
  "status": "In Progress"
}


### ==========================================
### DELETE COURSE
### ==========================================

### 10. Delete course
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/courses/3


### ==========================================
### SEARCH
### ==========================================

### 11. Search courses
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/search?q=Java


### 12. Search courses by Spring
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/search?q=Spring


### ==========================================
### STATISTICS
### ==========================================

### 13. Course statistics
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/stats


